[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0252","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3958","title":"Google Chrome 列跨度变量转换释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 17.0.963.46之前版本在处理CSS列跨度（column span）时存在变量类型转换不当导致的释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制HTML文档，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中访问，触发已释放内存的非法访问，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响Chrome 16.x及更早版本，CVSS评分6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3958"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-09T04:10:28Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:12Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 17.0.963.46 或更高版本，该版本修复了列跨度处理中的类型转换错误导致的使用后释放漏洞。如无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用 Chrome 的站点隔离功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=105459","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/02/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14948","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3958.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3958","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3958.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3958","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3958","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3958.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2011/CVE-2011-3958.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3958.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3958.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3958"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0251","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3953","title":"Google Chrome 粘贴事件剪贴板监控漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 17.0.963.46之前版本存在粘贴事件后剪贴板监控漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户执行粘贴操作，利用该漏洞监控剪贴板内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响Google Chrome 17.0.963.46之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过远程方式利用，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。Google已在Chrome 17.0.963.46版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3953"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-09T04:10:28Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:12Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 17.0.963.46 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 内置自动更新机制或访问 google.com/chrome 下载安装。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 对剪贴板的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=73478","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/02/stable-channel-update.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14392","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3953","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3953","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3953","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2011/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-39xx/CVE-2011-3953.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3953"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0251.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0225","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3460","title":"Apple QuickTime PNG文件处理栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 系统中的 QuickTime 组件在处理 PNG 文件时存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的 PNG 图片文件，当用户使用 QuickTime 或受影响浏览器打开该恶意文件时，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本及 Mac OS X 10.7.3 之前版本，无需用户交互即可远程利用，危害严重。Apple 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3460"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-02T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:19Z","remediation":"升级 QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本，并将 Mac OS X 更新至 10.7.3 或更高版本。如无法升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，避免在未受信任的网站上打开 PNG 文件，并考虑使用第三方媒体播放器替代 QuickTime 处理多媒体内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3460","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2011/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3460.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3460.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0224","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3459","title":"Apple QuickTime rdrf原子处理越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理特制影片文件中的 rdrf atom 时存在 off-by-one 缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送包含恶意 rdrf atom 的构造影片文件，当用户使用 QuickTime 打开该文件时触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Apple Mac OS X 10.7.3 之前版本及 QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本，攻击需诱导用户打开恶意文件，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3459"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-02T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:19Z","remediation":"升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本（Mac OS X 10.7.3 及以上系统已包含修复版本），可通过 Apple 软件更新功能或从 Apple 官网下载安装。如无法立即升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 .mov/.mp4 多媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3459","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2011/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3459.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3459.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0223","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3458","title":"Apple QuickTime MP4文件解析未初始化内存访问漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 在处理特制 MP4 文件时存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。由于 QuickTime 在解析 MP4 编码文件时未能正确初始化内存位置，远程攻击者可向目标用户发送恶意构造的 MP4 文件，诱导用户打开后触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Mac OS X 10.7.3 之前版本及 QuickTime 7.7.2 之前版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。用户需升级至 QuickTime 7.7.2 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3458"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-02T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:19Z","remediation":"升级 Apple QuickTime 至 7.7.2 或更高版本（Mac OS X 10.7.3 及以上系统已包含修复版本），可通过 Apple 软件更新功能或从 Apple 官网下载安装。如无法立即升级，建议不要打开来源不明的 MP4 文件，并在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00005.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5261","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2011/CVE-2011-3458.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3458.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3458","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3458.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2011/CVE-2011-3458.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3458.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3458.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2011/CVE-2011-3458.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2011/CVE-2011-3458.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3458.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0223.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0222","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3457","title":"Apple Mac OS X OpenGL GLSL 编译内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Mac OS X 10.7.3 之前版本的 OpenGL 实现中存在内存破坏漏洞。该漏洞源于 OpenGL 着色语言（GLSL）编译过程未正确处理特制程序，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 GLSL 着色器的网页或打开特制媒体文件，触发内存损坏，导致目标系统应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Apple 已在 Mac OS X 10.7.3 更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3457"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-02T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:19Z","remediation":"将 Apple Mac OS X 升级至 10.7.3 或更高版本（通过 Software Update 或从 Apple 支持网站下载组合更新），该版本修复了 OpenGL 着色语言编译中的内存破坏问题。对于 iOS 设备，升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可配置应用程序沙箱限制 OpenGL 程序的加载来源，并避免在受影响系统上处理来自不可信来源的 3D 渲染内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3457","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2011/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3457.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3457.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0236","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3670","title":"Mozilla Firefox IPv6字面地址语法跨域信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.6.26之前版本、4.x至6.0版本、Thunderbird 3.1.18之前版本及5.0至6.0版本、SeaMonkey 2.4之前版本中存在跨域信息泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于浏览器未能正确强制实施IPv6字面地址语法规则，远程攻击者可通过代理服务器发送特制的XMLHttpRequest请求，并读取返回的错误消息，从而获取敏感信息。攻击无需用户交互，仅需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发，影响机密性。Mozilla已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3670"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-01T16:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:44Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 3.6.26 或 7.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.18 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.4 及以上版本。临时缓解措施可配置代理服务器过滤包含 IPv6 文字地址的 XMLHttpRequest 请求，或限制浏览器对 IPv6 地址的解析能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00011.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2400","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2402","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2406","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:013","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-02.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=504014","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14814","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc