.0.912.77 之前版本中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，该漏洞源于对 DOM 选择操作的对象生命周期管理不当，导致已释放的内存仍可被访问。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 16.0.912.77 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3924"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-01-24T04:03:36Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 16.0.912.77 或更高版本，该版本已修复此释放后使用漏洞。受影响用户也可通过 Chrome 内置自动更新机制获取补丁。此外，该漏洞通过 WebKit 组件影响 Apple Safari（升级至 6.0+）、Apple iOS（升级至 6.0+）及 Apple iTunes（升级至 10.7+），相关用户应同步更新对应产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=106484","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/01/stable-channel-update_23.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/47694","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026569","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13887","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3924.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3924","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3924.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3924","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3924","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3924.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2011/CVE-2011-3924.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3924.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-3924.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3924"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0216","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0216.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3328","title":"libpng cHRM 除零错误拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libpng 1.5.4 版本的 pngrutil.c 文件中 png_handle_cHRM 函数存在除零错误漏洞。当启用色彩校正支持时，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统提交包含特定零值 cHRM 数据块的畸形 PNG 图像触发除零异常，导致应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 libpng 1.5.4 的应用程序及 Apple iOS 6.0 之前版本，攻击复杂度较高，需用户打开恶意构造的 PNG 文件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3328"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-01-17T19:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:05Z","remediation":"升级 libpng 至 1.5.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 png_handle_cHRM 函数中除零错误的缺陷。对于使用 libpng 的应用程序（如 Apple iOS 设备），请升级至 iOS 6.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在应用中禁用 libpng 的色彩校正功能（关闭 PNG_COLOR_CORRECTION_SUPPORTED 编译选项）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://libpng.org/pub/png/libpng.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=3406145&group_id=5624&atid=105624","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/477046","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=740864"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0216.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0247","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3919","title":"Google Chrome libxml2 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"libxml2 中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，当 Google Chrome 浏览器（版本低于 16.0.912.75）解析特制的 XML 数据时触发该漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开精心构造的 XML 文件，利用该漏洞造成浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务），甚至可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用 libxml2 库的 Google Chrome 浏览器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3919"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-01-07T11:55:13Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:09Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 16.0.912.75 及以上版本，该版本已修复 libxml2 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。对于使用 libxml2 的 Linux 发行版，升级 libxml2 至 2.7.8.9 及以上安全版本。Apple iOS 用户应升级至 iOS 6.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则过滤包含畸形 XML 的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=107128","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2012/01/stable-channel-update.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-11/msg00002.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0217.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/47449","http://secunia.com/advisories/55568","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2394","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:005","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51300","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026487","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14504","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3919.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d